    "full_news_content": "The Beauty Of Rajshahi | Tawhid Afridi | Kala Bhuna | Kalai Ruti | Mango | Rahi | Padma | Vlog 110। THE BEAUTY OF RAJSHAHI - KALA BHUNA - KALAI RUTI - PADMA RIVER - DHAKA TO RAJSHAHI Download the inDrive app now from the link below :-https://share.indrive.com/lhG6/Tawhid Where you can offer your own fare and The best part is here you can choose your driver based on their rating/car/pickup time. My team and I had an incredible time trying Rajshahi's famous dishes like Kalai ruti and kala bhuna. We also had a lot of fun exploring popular places such as Mango garden, Rajbari, and especially Rajshahi University. Rajshahi is known for being the cleanest city and is famous for its silk production. If I unintentionally made any mistakes in this vlog, then I sincerely apologize. RAJSHAHI :- Rajshahi is a metropolitan city and a major urban, commercial and educational centre of Bangladesh. It is also the administrative seat of the eponymous division and district. KALA BHUNA :- Kala bhuna is a meat curry made of beef or mutton, originated in Chittagong, Bangladesh. Different types of spices are needed to prepare this traditional dish of Chittagong. In Bengali, the word kala or kalo means black and bhuna means deep fry. RAJSHAHI UNIVERSITY :- The University of Rajshahi, also known as Rajshahi University or RU, is a PhD granting public research university located in Motihar, Rajshahi, Bangladesh. It is the second oldest university in Bangladesh. The university's sixty departments are organized into ten faculties. TAWHID AFRIDI - TAWHID AFRIDI NEW VLOG - RAJSHAHI VLOG DHAKA TO RAJSHAHI - RAJSHAHI - RAJSHAHI UNIVERSITY - SILK CITY MANGO GARDEN - KALAI RUTI - KALAI RUTI - MANGO CUTTING T BADH - I BADH - MANGO GARDEN - PADMA RIVER - VLOG 110 #Rajshahi #TawhidAfridi #CleanCity। সময় নিউজ ২৪ ভিডিও নিউজরুম থেকে সরাসরি প্রচারিত খবর। লাইভ ভিডিও প্রতিবেদন দেখতে ক্লিক করুন: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=W-E116OXRp8",
